Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 04:49:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Retain and reuse each persistent terminal original shpool
 daemon locator

Capture the absolute client and socket per owned session, persist them through a nullable append-only metadata migration and reuse them for restoration and destructive operations. Preserve existing connection replacement semantics and SSH protocol. Unknown legacy records require a positive session identity match and never create a replacement daemon. Keep all previous test data and assertions, populate the new locator slot in fixtures, and cover two real daemons with identical session names, drift, idempotence, unavailable locators, DB recovery and conflicting owners.
